      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The lake lies 19 miles east of Tacoma and 27 miles south‑southeast of Seattle, placing it within the greater Seattle‑Tacoma metro area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
